 lunch (bữa trưa), dinner (bữa tối) — nói \"for breakfast\" (cho bữa sáng).","lessonId":"u3n5l5","lessonVersion":"v2.u3n5l5","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u3n5","order":20,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u3n5l5","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec1","signature":"LIJ4CMBp_HQVV3mI0Qjf7gkd_GCSIyh3LYQxiKvUnm-SyVni_wZV2VtYqZLuSoVY-3sO2wWbkGiFpdvK6bjiCg","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["u3.vocab","u3.grammar","listening"],"title":"Bữa ăn trong ngày · Bài 5","unitId":"u3"}